ind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest and Galaxies Showcase","summary":"Hello, everyone! Lots of news today. The event in Barcelona went incredibly well, and thanks to all your support (and a couple more showcases), SOMBRAS: negative frames now has 12k wishlists! We hope that with this little number Steam will promote the game a little during its launch week. We still have time to reach many more people, which is why I wanted to announce today that we’ll be at both today’s Galaxies Autumn Showcase (links to YouTube and Twitch) and next week’s Steam Next Fest, where ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T10:12:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706677056","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4553370-1846018067925741","game_id":"steam-4553370","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo LIVE!","summary":"Hi everyone!You have no idea how fast this is going. Every week we reach a new milestone, and the game just keeps growing. Today, based on your valuable feedback from the private playtest, we’ve released the demo for SOMBRAS: negative frames for everyone.This demo will also be part of the upcoming Steam Next Fest, where we hope it will reach a wide audience so more people can learn about our new game :) (We really need it, not gonna lie!)New ContentFor everyone who participated in the playtest, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T10:53:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925741","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4553370-1842212951300638","game_id":"steam-4553370","kind":"update","title":"Playtest Update + Gamescom","summary":"Hi everyone! 👁️ How’s summer going? Here at Maboroshi, we haven’t stopped working! And that’s why we have some news for you: First of all, we’d like to sincerely thank all of you who played the demo and took the time to share your feedback, both on Steam and Discord (join us if you haven’t already!). We’re so happy that you’ve enjoyed our new project so much, and thanks to your comments, we can (hopefully!) make it a little better. We’ve been writing down and fixing everything we felt made the m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T16:20:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951300638","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4553370-1839041357026264","game_id":"steam-4553370","kind":"announcement","title":"SOMBRAS: negative frames - Release Date","summary":"Hi everyone! Unlike with our previous game, things seem to be moving much faster this time around. That’s why, just a few months after the first trailer, we’re thrilled to announce that: SOMBRAS: negative frames will be releasing on Steam and all other platforms on December 3, 2026! 🎉 Here’s the new trailer we’ve created for the announcement. Let us know what you think in the comments! And remember that you can also join the Maboroshi Discord to chat with the developers and the community to be u","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-23T10:09:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357026264","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4553370-1836506165578292","game_id":"steam-4553370","kind":"announcement","title":"SOMBRAS: negative frames Closed Playtest is here!","summary":"Hey everyone!We are incredibly excited to announce that we are opening the gates to a dark, mirrored world. SOMBRAS: negative frames is hosting an exclusive, CLOSED PLAYTEST right here on Steam, and we want you to be among the very first to experience it! This test is a crucial step for our team, and it will give you an early hands-on look at our core mechanics, environmental puzzles, and atmospheric narrative. Your participation will help us fine-tune the pacing and eerie dread before our offic","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-07T15:04:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165578292","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4553370-1833334318568128","game_id":"steam-4553370","kind":"announcement","title":"Revealing the next Maboroshi Artworks game SOMBRAS: negative frames","summary":"Some streets only appear after midnight...Welcome to SOMBRAS: negative frames, the next game from Maboroshi Artworks, the creators of the award-winning Last Time I Saw You.First of all, make sure to Wishlist and Follow the game! Updates about the development will only be visible in your library if you follow it, so make sure to do that if you want to be up to date! So, welcome—we’re very happy to have you here 🙂Let us know what you think of the trailer! We also partnered with our good friends at","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-21T07:15:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318568128","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4553370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:53:58Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:53:57Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4553370":"2026-10-26T02:53:58Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4553370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:5